{"version":1,"key":"article:10","content":{"id":10,"title":"渐变色的妙用","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e45a20b7-e00b-4004-85b2-a3e7e9df38e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 CSS 中渐变色作为背景可以制作出非常绚丽，迷人的效果，往往我们将焦点聚集在渐变上面，而忽略了它作为背景图片的作用，在这里我将介绍两个渐变色作为背景色以及背景图片的妙用，可以实现一些难以实现的效果。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a0b06e0f-1b4b-4981-93b9-17ffe7abf7df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"透明背景蒙层"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a6c4d202-6fd1-4ed1-987e-a4ff6169e35f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我在一个实际的应用开发中，UI 给的背景图是一张图片加上一个透明颜色的蒙层背景合成而得的。当时 UI 只给了没有添加蒙层的图片，并告诉我实际的图片是如上做出来的。我当时表示 OK，觉得自己可以搞出来。"}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px;\">\n  <img src=\"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_752c7b33-3c3c-4607-84e0-17dc5bd38a8d.webp\" style=\"zoom: 50%; width: 100%; box-shadow: none;\">\n  <img src=\"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1a5cfdba-e570-422a-a792-df9f79a8794e.webp\" style=\"zoom: 50%; width: 100%; box-shadow: none;\"> \n</div>","collabId":"ea3bc44d-c58f-4649-94e8-0a09874eb87b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c16fcae3-dd08-43fe-a4fd-92411e5c74f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"背景色？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b844765-61af-45ed-8b54-cd945f521af4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一次尝试，使用一个透明的背景色"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"2c76ce4d-e6dc-4151-9076-09f95b3605d4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"75cbe5c3-83ce-43f5-874b-2e93962c779a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"background: url('./bg.png') rgba(237, 240, 242, 0.8);","collabId":"5c427cd8-b865-41ea-8e29-7971b0f091fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0355d9a1-b6d5-414a-b0d2-c662666140e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"很显然是没用的，因为背景色是一直在背景图片下面的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c2a078b-8193-42ce-b8eb-9172ac15effc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是我知道通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"background"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是可以设置多层背景，所以我将背景色设置在另一层背景上可不可以呢"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"436f6496-9690-41d8-9f97-3d95f55c509f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1b349b28-e1a3-4b9f-b07b-6a32521a3db7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"background: rgba(237, 240, 242, 0.8), url('bg.png');","collabId":"e28319eb-2a06-46e5-8a76-7ca44a7e7318","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"013a3416-72a1-4c8f-99ac-2e03b27e41dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是发现不仅没有蒙层效果，而且连背景图片都消失了，后来我查规范才知道，对于"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"背景色只能设置一次，并且只能设置在最后一层背景中"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以这个方案不通。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a1c78c14-5c71-4c06-bb76-804ed95774de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"多层 DOM"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1d3082ea-eb68-47a9-b3ae-cb3b3eb0a463","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用多层 DOM 结构，使得它们在不同的层，背景图片在底部，接着是透明背景色，接着是内容"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"1b7078c9-7f4c-45e5-863f-69f8c09281c3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6faf61dd-d260-4d1f-904e-c17291f3b714","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<div class=\"bg\">\n  <div class=\"color\">\n    <div class=\"content\">...</div>\n  <div>\n</div>","collabId":"3a5e8d29-d6e8-4367-856f-f69f33f8efd0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"5ba3b27e-5fcc-4a4e-9bf7-72e7f8554f80","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"394e71b2-f2cf-498f-8aa4-bb75ec96634a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":".bg {\n  background: url('bg.png') no-repeat center / contain;\n}\n.color {\n  background: rgba(237, 240, 242, 0.8);\n}","collabId":"dd957372-8cc4-496e-ba34-2e6d5d178a45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f584b7a-4968-49c7-bc5e-e995bf3f8c6a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以实现效果，但是多了几层无意义的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"div"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1729969c-1be0-42a2-b04e-e494962ae89e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"渐变色"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf62d100-37bd-4db6-8155-77525b6f02e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有没有更加简单的方法，后面我在机缘巧合下发现了，渐变色在背景里面是充当背景图片来用的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"7be0dc68-aa38-4a71-a7a5-b3cf2697cdbe","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c5111cc1-7733-4e90-8f16-1f5bfa65a9a2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"background-image: linear-gardient(...);","collabId":"760b17b9-d538-4ab7-b374-24f91bd8f467","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e3528481-450d-4b9d-9365-4c8de3917d3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"既然背景色只能出现在最后一层，但是渐变色是背景图片，它可以出现在其它背景图片的上面，只要将渐变色的两个颜色设置为一样，就是一个颜色了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"7de24a5c-a20f-4691-89cc-09a425d551cf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6131a363-444e-4281-a834-12eaa235382f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"background: \n  linear-gradient(rgba(237, 240, 242, 0.8), rgba(237, 240, 242, 0.8)),\n  url('./bg,png') no-repeat center / contain;","collabId":"c606596f-1e86-47ff-b08e-9aa97fc289e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d580476b-d714-4e5e-894a-6063c77069fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"当然最简单的办法就是让 UI 发一张合成后的图片过来 ... ..."}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"b8b5efab-e8d8-4b64-a2ed-be5d8dc6d064","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"背景色块"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5463bf17-ced0-4e28-9141-983255f29c79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在一个项目中，要实现如下效果"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/4.54ry6ajplf00.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/4.54ry6ajplf00.png","naturalWidth":360,"naturalHeight":174,"width":187.79058410112924,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"772caec2-f492-49f3-af2e-12d7a274e495","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"53b704d8-9be8-4461-84ab-678221c39443","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在特定的文字下面有一条线，线是带圆角的并且在字的下面，这个如何实现？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b7f1c085-c1d1-402a-9476-b616da9af4fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一种方案，背景图片，将下面的线切出来，然后作为背景放在字的下面，但是如果字数一旦发生改变，你就得重新切图，这个方案是不得已而为之。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d9cb9fec-9524-472a-b3a5-737f5a24e728","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二种方案使用定位，考虑使用伪元素来画这条线，然后定位在下方"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"562c2e09-ad06-4ad9-9d6e-809fa83516c1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c14c7c73-e8de-4ed7-80f7-0760553ed7ad","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<em>地上霜</em>","collabId":"5f1d705e-b59a-4bb3-9a80-c0fe62e79986","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"14c3c997-c359-4f4f-9cfc-91f6edbe2bf2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2eec14be-1131-4794-baa9-ab6621f0660d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"em {\n  position: relative;\n  &::after {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    display: block;\n    content: '';\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 10px;\n    background: #45b787;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n  }\n}","collabId":"3e933dd5-cb7b-4ee3-b960-d1281243f6ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9971353b-fe35-4fe8-84b0-53bc2e8f28c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是发现下面这条线会"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"压住文字"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并且对于"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"换行的文字"},{"type":"formatted","text":"无效。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/1.4v599rukurs0.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/1.4v599rukurs0.png","width":180,"naturalWidth":360,"naturalHeight":174,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"cec2c195-7470-4b4a-a70c-a2c444bc13a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b506a3fe-f0eb-464d-85f5-415f4a3c3061","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"线会压住文字，因为子元素是一定在父元素的上层，所以我们改变一下文档结构，使得文字和底部的线是兄弟关系，通过改变它们的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"z-index"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 使得线在文字的下方"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"0fdab619-166f-406c-9041-e16851aa0873","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"78b7cbc7-5815-4d0b-b279-4f44f5b9bf19","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<em>\n  <span class=\"words\">地上霜</span>\n  <span class=\"line\"></span>\n</em>","collabId":"abfa557d-83b4-4aec-9fd4-deb87743cd50","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"4809919f-bd9f-418c-a347-a29cf911385d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"40808734-dfee-4dbb-9d18-f01266047fd6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"em {\n  position: relative;\n    .words {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n    .line {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 1;\n      left: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      display: block;\n      content: '';\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 10px;\n      background: #45b787;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n    }\n}","collabId":"82d7c5fc-3786-4ae2-95f8-e101666c94ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/2.ir6ms555uqo.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/2.ir6ms555uqo.png","width":180,"naturalWidth":360,"naturalHeight":174,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f1ad67d6-8147-45ec-ace5-a66936661633","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"669d1d3e-22f7-44b3-be3f-0d1eded2328c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此种方法解决了线会压住文字的问题，但是如果文字换行的话，还是会丢失样式，所以这个方案不可用。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"667ec8f8-1e5c-4a22-8a04-b348c81bffa6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面就是终极的解决方案，使用渐变色来绘制图片，我们可以将下面的线分为三个部分，中间的一条线以及左右两边的两个圆。首先 DOM 结构如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"9f5393ea-4ff3-4905-8af9-6d2354d89621","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8c9ab1a8-36cc-4a42-87de-d1ad7d462aa9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<em>地上霜</em>","collabId":"a0d4e577-5cbf-4f32-8257-8f29cb6447de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20c326fe-5dc9-46d3-a447-e00dcea3e243","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们使用线性渐变色来绘制这个线"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"1102367c-317c-4bc6-a3b9-a50b65d460f4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c4bf06c8-bb2a-453a-860f-b3a639c4e3cb","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"em {\n  background: \n    linear-gradient(#45b787, #45b787) no-repeat center bottom / calc(100% - 10px) 10px;\n}","collabId":"b43bc894-2368-4cd1-8967-ab6a74e7973b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"618e8293-d62f-4722-a9da-bd558046c320","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"线的宽度为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"calc(100% - 10px)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，左右各留 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"5px"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来放圆。因为是背景，所以会在文字的下方，并且即使是换行也没有问题"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/3.3glu87q32om0.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/3.3glu87q32om0.png","naturalWidth":360,"naturalHeight":174,"width":187.79058410112924,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"d580bbf1-5b69-4983-8f75-e5c6b1f1d472","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8b02ad62-b9c7-48e4-b04e-0b76c48aa795","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面使用径向渐变来绘制圆，首先来看径向渐变的语法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"a6916ab3-8c34-4818-895c-220f9410ec2a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cac015d5-b612-4124-bbed-9bc845fa79ad","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"radial-gradient(shape size at x-position y-position, color1 stop1, color2 stop2, ...);","collabId":"12ce4118-7ce7-4226-9619-2e8fe44125fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6d507910-db15-444f-b3ac-f20c0723eea4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"shape 表示径向渐变的形状，常见的包括 circle、ellipse ； size 表示形状的大小，对于圆来说就是直径；(x-position, y-position) 表示圆心的坐标；后面的 (color, stop) 就用来表示渐变色了。使用径向渐变绘制圆可以套用如下模板"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"a9bc116e-b467-4ec5-93a5-9b3c3e4edba2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"10adf695-bea8-4e8d-9200-04678baa889f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"radial-gradient(circle size at x-position y-position, color1 50%, transparent 50%);","collabId":"007dbfc0-79e8-4c40-b780-fc0fdbed0137","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"95382878-7afc-4a5b-b6f2-3e6b264623ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来我们只需要设置圆的大小，以及原因位置，填充颜色即可，例如对于直线左边的圆，它的大小是 10px ，圆心位于直线左边的中心，也就是离左边 5px ，离底部 5px ，填充颜色同直线为 #45b787 ，所以左边的圆可以如下绘制"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"14ce494a-dfd3-4823-b6e1-4ddf68e5784b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4a4c3a25-6484-4e99-9ace-c72b608842dd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"radial-gradient(circle 10px at 5px calc(100% - 5px), #45b787 50%, transparent 50%);","collabId":"15dc42f2-1478-400d-8a52-eabd12dfc168","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7149d83f-d852-44d4-a77b-2744bc8a0b11","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面 y-position 设置为 calc(100% - 5px) 表示距离底部 5px 。同理右边圆的绘制如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"ba53f7a5-14c5-41df-b968-048b3c8aa952","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0d1a310c-257c-4d7e-a269-932dca717d7d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"radial-gradient(circle 10px at calc(100% - 5px) calc(100% - 5px), #45b787 50%, transparent 50%);","collabId":"ad622f8e-6f73-4a7e-91c3-082d4fbdad61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"299c2523-520c-43ff-a3e5-a9c84cb6d834","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"右边圆的 x-position 设置为了 calc(100% - 5px) 表示距离右侧 5px 。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91352080-31f0-45b6-a57f-50ac50b079c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"综合以上，全部的样式如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"a79aa92d-0b1d-4a07-aa84-32721a